<title>UK: Paragon sells its Care UK 7% stake.</title>
<headline>Paragon sells its Care UK 7% stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paragon Group of Companies Plc said on Thursday it sold its entire 7.0 percent stake in healthcare services company Care UK Plc for 122p per share.</p>
</text>
